  "identity": "Wins through Josedeodo-led jungle tempo (+728 GD@15), a reliable carry top (Morgan) and CoreJJ engage; can play zone-control or fast skirmish. Converts leads (100% WR when ahead @15, baron 77%). Loses when behind early and with Quid's lane deficits; got out-fought early at MSI (FB 25%, GD@15 -184) and went 0-6 in games vs T1.",
  "draft": "Wide pools (7-9 champions per player in 11 games), no single obvious ban-out. Josedeodo Qiyana 3-0/Lee Sin 2-0; Morgan Camille 3-0; Yeon Ashe/Lucian 2-0; CoreJJ Nautilus 2-0. League-wide top bans in LCS Summer PO: Cassiopeia 37, Nocturne 29. Team-specific ban data UNKNOWN.",
